{"3085180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rat Climber", "steam_appid": 3085180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a rat. You must climb. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheese and glory await!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rat Climber, you only have one goal: reach the top of the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate vertical labyrinth zones and make daring jumps, but be careful; one false move and you go tumbling down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three different modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/60f7ef981022d637adbb7c01ce656c89.avif?t=1785580405\" width=1200 height=716 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints menu enabled, allowing for custom save-load checkpoints, as well as three specific world checkpoints. Play at your own pace and learn the path up, one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The normal Rat Climber experience. Checkpoints disabled. Achievements for reaching the end of each world enabled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For speed-runners, or those wanting to practice a specific part. Checkpoints menu enabled, as well as superjump, which basically allows Ratty to fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have access to the level-specific restart option, letting you restart at any of the 12 zones across both worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two different worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through two different worlds for twice the rodent fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ratty's World: The original seven Rat Climber levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seaside Village, Crystal Mines, Cypress Swamp, Ancient Egypt, Mystic Towers, Cloud Temple, Shadow Castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream World: Five more bonus levels in a separate world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Cove, Tempest Tavern, Playground, Foggy Fortress, Lush Ruins (with more in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/ad219cb15f2d27eeb7da8297fb064fac.avif?t=1785580405\" width=762 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secret cheese</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There aren't hundreds of collectibles for you to worry about, only a single secret cheese per level, well hidden and off the beaten path...Can you find all seven?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every object has 1-to-1 exact collision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there's a small gap between objects, you can probably fit through. A 3 inch ledge? You can stand on it, Ratty! Building ledges are the highways of the rodent world, as they say. Start thinking like a <i>rat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/79519c14cbcb997ea37e2c8673adcb5a.avif?t=1785580405\" width=384 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful signs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Rat ancestors left helpful tip signs all around the world. They will give you useful advice and encouragement on your journey. Be sure to look for the golden sparkles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/1aa920a5a6095f50747b97142f5a23f2.avif?t=1785580405\" width=454 height=286 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are <i>only</i> 3 controls: Jump, dash, and walk </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dash lets you jump farther  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/cdfe6a9eb5ee661af50f6ace0704ce2a.poster.avif?t=1785580405\" width=366 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/cdfe6a9eb5ee661af50f6ace0704ce2a.webm?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/cdfe6a9eb5ee661af50f6ace0704ce2a.mp4?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The safety walk <i>prevents you from walking off of ledges</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/bf02a83854bef6471f0a37498e45995a.poster.avif?t=1785580405\" width=368 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/bf02a83854bef6471f0a37498e45995a.webm?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/bf02a83854bef6471f0a37498e45995a.mp4?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for speed-running</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rat Climber was built for speed-running! There are a multitude of speedrun tools built into the game, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall timer that starts as soon as Ratty moves and automatically stops once you reach the final spot at end of game and lose control of Ratty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual level timers (both split times and segment lengths) that automatically record times when you reach new levels, no need to manually start and stop your own custom timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superjump (allows you to fly) [only in speedrun mode]. There's also option to disable this, so you don't accidentally press it and invalidate a speed-run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom save and load checkpoints to practice hard sections or skips </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart at specific levels instead of the bottom of world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart hotkey that must be pressed twice (prevents accidental restarts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Speedrun website board with moderators, rules, and runners!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Ratty to the top of the world and reach cheese heaven? Try your skills in the best 3D <strong>Ratformer</strong> ever made!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls (Keyboard+Mouse and Xbox controllers supported!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/f4200241009230f3190dedade4673ac8.avif?t=1785580405\" width=448 height=500 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a rat. You must climb. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheese and glory await!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rat Climber, you only have one goal: reach the top of the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate vertical labyrinth zones and make daring jumps, but be careful; one false move and you go tumbling down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three different modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/60f7ef981022d637adbb7c01ce656c89.avif?t=1785580405\" width=1200 height=716 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints menu enabled, allowing for custom save-load checkpoints, as well as three specific world checkpoints. Play at your own pace and learn the path up, one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The normal Rat Climber experience. Checkpoints disabled. Achievements for reaching the end of each world enabled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For speed-runners, or those wanting to practice a specific part. Checkpoints menu enabled, as well as superjump, which basically allows Ratty to fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have access to the level-specific restart option, letting you restart at any of the 12 zones across both worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two different worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through two different worlds for twice the rodent fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ratty's World: The original seven Rat Climber levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seaside Village, Crystal Mines, Cypress Swamp, Ancient Egypt, Mystic Towers, Cloud Temple, Shadow Castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream World: Five more bonus levels in a separate world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Cove, Tempest Tavern, Playground, Foggy Fortress, Lush Ruins (with more in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/ad219cb15f2d27eeb7da8297fb064fac.avif?t=1785580405\" width=762 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secret cheese</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There aren't hundreds of collectibles for you to worry about, only a single secret cheese per level, well hidden and off the beaten path...Can you find all seven?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every object has 1-to-1 exact collision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there's a small gap between objects, you can probably fit through. A 3 inch ledge? You can stand on it, Ratty! Building ledges are the highways of the rodent world, as they say. Start thinking like a <i>rat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/79519c14cbcb997ea37e2c8673adcb5a.avif?t=1785580405\" width=384 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful signs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Rat ancestors left helpful tip signs all around the world. They will give you useful advice and encouragement on your journey. Be sure to look for the golden sparkles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/1aa920a5a6095f50747b97142f5a23f2.avif?t=1785580405\" width=454 height=286 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are <i>only</i> 3 controls: Jump, dash, and walk </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dash lets you jump farther  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/cdfe6a9eb5ee661af50f6ace0704ce2a.poster.avif?t=1785580405\" width=366 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/cdfe6a9eb5ee661af50f6ace0704ce2a.webm?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/cdfe6a9eb5ee661af50f6ace0704ce2a.mp4?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The safety walk <i>prevents you from walking off of ledges</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/bf02a83854bef6471f0a37498e45995a.poster.avif?t=1785580405\" width=368 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/bf02a83854bef6471f0a37498e45995a.webm?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/bf02a83854bef6471f0a37498e45995a.mp4?t=1785580405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for speed-running</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rat Climber was built for speed-running! There are a multitude of speedrun tools built into the game, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall timer that starts as soon as Ratty moves and automatically stops once you reach the final spot at end of game and lose control of Ratty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual level timers (both split times and segment lengths) that automatically record times when you reach new levels, no need to manually start and stop your own custom timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superjump (allows you to fly) [only in speedrun mode]. There's also option to disable this, so you don't accidentally press it and invalidate a speed-run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom save and load checkpoints to practice hard sections or skips </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart at specific levels instead of the bottom of world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart hotkey that must be pressed twice (prevents accidental restarts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Speedrun website board with moderators, rules, and runners!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide Ratty to the top of the world and reach cheese heaven? Try your skills in the best 3D <strong>Ratformer</strong> ever made!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls (Keyboard+Mouse and Xbox controllers supported!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/extras/f4200241009230f3190dedade4673ac8.avif?t=1785580405\" width=448 height=500 /></span></p>", "short_description": "You are a rat. You must climb. Can you reach the top of the world? Cheese and glory await!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/header.jpg?t=1785580405", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785580405", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785580405", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"mi